      "artist": "Unknown authorUnknown author or not provided",
      "description": "Scope and content:  The original database describes this as:\nDescription: Dark and Oblique Earth Observation taken by the Apollo 9 crew. View is of  the Sudan and Nile River. Film magazine was D,film type was SO-368 Ektachrome with 0.460 - 0.710 micrometers film / filter transmittance response and haze filter,80mm lens. Latitude was 16.15 N by Longitude 30.34 E, Overlap was 0%, Altitude miles were 102 and cloud cover was 0%.\nSubject Terms: Apollo 9 Flight, Earth Observations (From Space)\nCategories: Earth Observations\nOriginal: Film - 70MM CT\nInterior_Exterior: Exterior\n\nGround_Orbit: On-orbit",
      "dateCreated": "11 March 1969<div style=\"display: none;\">date QS:P571,+1969-03-11T00:00:00Z/11</div>",
